  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support IMF D4D TF 2019 - 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Putting more and better data in the hands of decision-makers to enhance evidence-based macroeconomic policies and support the achivement of the SDGs.  Focus:  Strenghten national statistical systems to cope with a more challenging national and international policy environment, promote transparency and accountability, and offer efficient solutions to capacity development.</narrative>
  </description>
